 This install applies to "Road Rash" (c) 1992 Electronic Arts - 2 disks.

 Requirements:
 -------------
 WHDLoad 19 or newer must be installed in the path.
 The installed program requires 1 MB ChipMem and memory for WHDLoad and the
 slave. Enhanced framerate uses an optional 564 KB OtherMem allocation;
 Fast RAM and a 68020 or faster are recommended. PRELOAD needs additional
 memory for the game files. No Kickstart image is required by this slave.
 Quit with Help (changeable with the WHDLoad QuitKey tooltype).

 Features:
 ---------
 Runs from hard disk, with disk protection removed. Supports joystick,
 keyboard arrows and CD32 joypad, including name and password entry.
 The original manual and a choice of five icons are included.

 Options:
 --------
 CUSTOM1 selects one of the preset passwords in the WHDLoad startup options.
 CUSTOM accepts a user-defined password; see the format and examples below.
 CUSTOM2=1 enables "Enhanced framerate". It is off by default; omit CUSTOM2
 or use CUSTOM2=0 for original timing. Visual bug fixes apply in both modes.

 Enhanced framerate uses Fast RAM for smoother, vsynced play while keeping
 game logic at a consistent speed. It enables caches unless NoCache is set.
 A 68000 with Fast RAM benefits from rendering improvements; Chip-only
 machines and machines without suitable memory use the original path.
 Opponent paths and collision outcomes may differ with the option enabled.

CD32 controls - menu:

F1 - RW/reverse:
F2 - FF/forward:
F3 - Blue: enter password / select bike
F4 - Green: control method 1
F5 - Yellow: control method 2

To select a letter to input, use reverse & forward. This acts like
Earok "virtual keyboard": enters the letter then performs a cursor left
To select this letter, just use joystick right.

CD32 controls - game:

Space - PLAY: pause
F10 - reverse+forward: quit current game

Custom password:

The format matters: 5 chars - 2 spaces - 10 chars - 2 spaces - 5 chars
Ex: whdload roadrash.slave preload custom="00000  01420019G5  457VO"

There are 2 spaces above, regardless of your html viewer displays, like:

whdload roadrash.slave preload custom="00000<space><space>01420019G5<space><space>457VO"

Thanks to Marc Kelkermans for the original disks (and to the many people who sent me
original disks of other games)

Some level codes (thanx to Abaddon and SweetCheater). Those are already built into the slave

        "00000 00J00 102VS 21JUD"   PANDA 600
        "00000 00J01 113BT 22KDP"   BANZAI 750
        "00000 00R00 013VS 32RV4"   BANZAI 750
        "00000 00S20 117H5 33UV1"   KAMIKAZE 750
        "00000 01421 109G5 448VN"   SHURIKEN 1000
        "00000 01420 019G5 457VO"   FERRUCI 850
        "00000 01S91 OOEGJ 567HM"   PANDA 750
        "00000 01S90 10EGJ 576IK"   DIABLO 1000
        "00000 01O00 MTPN8 4NPBI"   To give millions of $ and level 4


View ending sequence:
Press [F3] at the track select screen to display the password screen. Enter 11111 02881 RNLKC 5FJ7K as a password, then start the race.
Press [F10] to quit, then press Fire at the repair cost screen to view the ending sequence. After that, the game will restart at level 1 with the Diablo 1000 bike.

Start with Diablo:
Enter 00000 REDC0 QNGM5 172SU as a password to start at level 1 with the Diablo 1000 and a large amount of money.

Source: GameWinners.com ,  http://www.gamewinners.com

 History:
 --------
 Version 3.0 (22.10.2026) done by Versuri/JOTD:
 - optional Enhanced framerate for smoother, vsynced play on Fast RAM Amigas
 - consistent simulation speed on the accelerated path, with reduced visible
   steering lag and corrected opponent lane occupancy
 - fixed distant and mirror bike flicker and vertical jumps on hills
 - fixed joystick steering recentring and keyboard/CD32 pause handling
 - fixed a loading crash on uncached 68030 machines
 - blanked the border during play on ECS/AGA machines
 - updated installer; cancelling replacement preserves an existing installation
 - adapted to whdload ReadJoyPad routine
 
 Version 2.0 (18.08.2019) done by JOTD:
 - adapted to whdload v17
 - joypad support (issue #0003626)
 - when joypad is detected, game control text is adapted. Function
   keys become joypad buttons in the game messages.
 - ability to enter some preset passwords at startup
 - ability to enter user defined password with CUSTOM tooltype
 - arrows mapped to joystick directions (issue #0002670)
 - enter names/passwords with joypad (no need for keyboard anymore)
 - source code included

 Version 1.3 (2002):
 - reworked install script. Files are now in the "data" directory,
 - manual included
 - added a ton of icons

 Version 1.2:
 - fixed remaining disk access

 Version 1.1:
 - fixed delay to see the map

 Version 1.0 (1997):

 - Full run from HD using WHDLoad
 - Memory patch to avoid to use 32 bit fast memory
 - Password protection removed (no more protection screen)

 Contact:
 --------
 If you have problems with this installation please try and get a newer
 version of this package from the WHDLoad WWW-Page. If that doesn't help try
 some Tooltypes like NOCACHE, NOAUTOVEC, EXPCHIP, NOMMU, PAL or NTSC. If
 that also fails, please inform the author via the Bug-Report-Form which
 can be accessed on the WHDLoad WWW-Page.

 For the full WHDLoad package, other installs and updates refer to:
	http://www.whdload.de/
